# Records docs/img/demo.gif with VHS (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs). From the repo root:
#   cp .env.example .env && docker compose up -d --build     (baseline API on :8183, fixed API on :8184)
#   vhs docs/demo.tape
# Steps 1 and 2 run LIVE against the two running APIs. Step 3 reads the committed isolation-tester
# results (generated by `python -m isolation_tester run`, see isolation-tester/README.md).
Output docs/img/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 720
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Type "# 1) Baseline API: a Globex user asks for an Acme invoice by id" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "targets/tenant-api/exploits/A-01-bola-invoice-by-id.sh" Enter
Wait+Screen@60s /Fixed behaviour/
Sleep 4s

Type "clear" Enter
Type "# 2) Same request against the fixed API" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "API_BASE=http://localhost:8184 targets/tenant-api/exploits/A-01-bola-invoice-by-id.sh" Enter
Wait+Screen@60s /Fixed behaviour/
Sleep 4s

Type "clear" Enter
Type "# 3) Isolation tester, 115 cross-tenant probes: leaks found, before vs after the fix" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "for m in baseline fixed; do printf '%-9s LEAK verdicts: %s\n' $m $(grep -c '| \*\*LEAK\*\* |' results/isolation-tester/$m/isolation-matrix.md); done" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "grep -h 'Actual leaked' results/isolation-tester/{baseline,fixed}/isolation-matrix.md" Enter
Sleep 5s
